2b:["$","p",null,{"children":["The service name is fixed. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Resource::builder().with_service_name(\"forge\")"}],"\nis called unconditionally, so ",["$","code",null,{"children":"OTEL_SERVICE_NAME"}]," does not change what appears\non your spans. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"service.instance.id"}]," is a fresh UUIDv4 generated per process,\nwhich means it changes on every restart: useful for telling replicas apart,\nuseless as a stable series identity."]}]
